# Personal agent rules; never committed
CLAUDE.local.md
# Local state of code-analysis tools used by agents
.serena/
# Environment files can hold secrets; only key templates are committed.
# Letter classes make this case-insensitive on every OS, like the leak guard.
.[eE][nN][vV]
.[eE][nN][vV].*
!.[eE][nN][vV].[eE][xX][aA][mM][pP][lL][eE]
!.[eE][nN][vV].[sS][aA][mM][pP][lL][eE]
!.[eE][nN][vV].[tT][eE][mM][pP][lL][aA][tT][eE]
# Key material, by name. The leak guard denies the same list, so a forced add still stops
# at the push: keep the two in step (a test in xtask/src/leak_guard.rs checks).
# Letter classes, as for .env above, so other spellings match on every OS.
*.[pP][eE][mM]
*.[kK][eE][yY]
*.[pP]12
*.[pP][fF][xX]
*.[jJ][kK][sS]
*.[kK][eE][yY][sS][tT][oO][rR][eE]
*.[pP][pP][kK]
*.[tT][fF][vV][aA][rR][sS]
*.[tT][fF][vV][aA][rR][sS].[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
[iI][dD]_[rR][sS][aA]
[iI][dD]_[dD][sS][aA]
[iI][dD]_[eE][cC][dD][sS][aA]
[iI][dD]_[eE][dD]25519
.[nN][eE][tT][rR][cC]
.[pP][yY][pP][iI][rR][cC]
[cC][rR][eE][dD][eE][nN][tT][iI][aA][lL][sS].[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
[sS][eE][rR][vV][iI][cC][eE]-[aA][cC][cC][oO][uU][nN][tT].[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
[sS][eE][cC][rR][eE][tT][sS].[tT][oO][mM][lL]
[sS][eE][cC][rR][eE][tT][sS].[yY][aA][mM][lL]
[sS][eE][cC][rR][eE][tT][sS].[yY][mM][lL]
[sS][eE][cC][rR][eE][tT][sS].[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
